WEBVTT

17:22.875 --> 17:24.250
What's up, Fazil?

17:25.792 --> 17:27.334
Hello, sir. I'm Surya.

17:27.625 --> 17:29.292
Are you expecting me to introduce myself?

17:29.375 --> 17:31.834
Not at all. Who doesn't
know Narayana Prabha?

17:32.667 --> 17:34.709
He told me you hit him because
he set the clock ten minutes ahead.

17:36.584 --> 17:37.625
He could've lost his eye.
